		{"excall", call=0, file="hat020030"},
		line=1216,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"After my battle with Hotori ended...",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"We rushed over to the Imperial Temple to treat Akari and\nHotori's injuries.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“How are you feeling, ma'am?”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"Kotone breaks the silence she's held ever since beginning with the treatment.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Thank you... I'm fi─”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Kkhh!”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Please refrain from exerting yourself!”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I managed to seal your external injuries as best as I could, but your insides are still in tatters.”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Ugh... Alright.”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"Hotori meekly settles down.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"When she fought me, Hotori moved in ways that pushed her body beyond its very limits.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"All of her muscles and tendons must be severely damaged.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“How about you, Akari?”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm good. The pain's all gone.”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"Akari rotates her previously broken arm.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"Looks like there's no problem.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's been a while since you've treated me like this, Kotone.”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Takes me back to when we were in Iseya.”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Indeed, I feel the same way.”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“You were always covered in scratches day in and day out, were you not?”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Treating you was a most excellent means of training my Healing magicks.”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What, so I was your guinea pig?”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“P-Perish the thought!”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“In fact, I considered you my lucky albatross! As the cricket on my hearth!”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Oh yes, that is right! Surely you are all famished from everything you have been through?”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“If I remember correctly, we had some spare rice cakes used as offerings.”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Akari & Soujin"},
			{
"“I could definitely go for─” “To think of food at a time like─”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm starving, actually.”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Hehee. In that case, I shall be right back.”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"Kotone must be every bit as tired as we are, but she\ndoesn't let it show as she heads out of the hall.",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...Sorry.”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Don't mention it.”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"Akari makes a show of clearing her throat to disguise her awkwardness.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Oh, yeah. What happened at the Armistice Day ceremony? Have you heard anything?”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah. I managed to gather some information while Kotone was Healing you two.”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"I explain the situation to Akari and Hotori.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"According to the news on the television, there was a large explosion at the venue during the middle of the Armistice Day ceremony.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"It seems that there were many casualties, but Empress Hisui and the other VIPs were not among them.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"It still remains unclear whether it was an accident or an intentional attack.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I hate to say this, but it wasn't that warrior Maki, was it?”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm worried about that as well.”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I got the Sworn Blades' spy to look into it.”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"Before I can say any more, the door to the hall gently slides open.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“My apologies for keeping you waiting.”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“There were indeed plenty of rice cakes remaining!”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"The tray she lays on the floor is laden with several large rice cakes.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Now, let us eat.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"The three of us reach out for the food.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Can you eat, Hotori?”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'll pass.”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"She shakes her head weakly.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"But rather than her physical condition, her expression indicates that she simply isn't in the mood to eat anything.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hey, Kotone?”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Mmm, mmm, mmm... What might it be?”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“How old are these rice cakes?”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I believe they were made yesterday.”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“They are the leftovers from our temple's offerings, so I do beg your pardon.”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"I eat one myself.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"I see. The rice inside has hardened.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Is it all right for us to be eating offerings?”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It is most permissible, of course.”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“In fact, to eat leftover offerings is an act which communes with Oomikami directly, so it is a great honor indeed.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"According to Kotone, offerings become the sanctified property of Oomikami the moment they are offered.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"And to partake of such consecrated food is to come into common union with Oomikami directly.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"There could be no greater honor than for Oomikami's divine gift to become one's own flesh and blood.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"When I understand the reasoning, even this hardened rice begins to taste good.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"We feel more at ease after filling ourselves on the rice cakes.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Soujin, I...”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			{
"Hotori pulls herself up into a sitting posture.",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You don't have to get up.”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Don't worry about me.”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"Her body must be screaming at her, but Hotori still sits upright with her back straight.",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Soujin... I hurt you...”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“And Miyaguni as well.”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“How can I ever forgive myself for turning my blade on the Imperial Princess?”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"Hotori clenches her fist on top of her lap.",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What's done is done.”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Why did you spare me?”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"She asks, barely above a whisper.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"Were our positions reversed, I would be thinking the same thing.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"But on the other hand, I'm relieved that we were able to resolve things without bloodshed.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"If she hadn't shown signs of regaining her sanity in that moment I went for her neck, I would certainly have killed her.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"I would have had no choice but to kill her.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			{
"It matters not even if they are your own kindred; you must cut down all those who wish harm upon your lord. Such is the fealty of a warrior.",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“We all made it out alive, so let's just treat it as water under the bridge, alright?”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"Before the war, turning your blade upon a member of the Imperial Family would unconditionally merit the death penalty.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Hotori-sama was under the spell of the blade she was wielding.”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I believe she is every bit as much of a victim here.”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			{
"Kotone unwraps the cloth package by her side.",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"Inside are the two broken halves of Hatsushimo.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"It was the spellblade Hotori was using.",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I was being controlled?”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“In all likelihood, yes.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“In addition to its original enchantments, I believe the blade has been imbued with magicks intended to lead\none's heart astray.”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Now that you mention it, I think I remember the blade speaking to me.”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Blades can talk now?”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Spellblades are forged from the souls of priestesses.”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I would not find it strange if a high-class spellblade were to have a will of its own.”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"Hotori and I share a nod.",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"I'm sure most warriors could understand what she means.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I remember feeling a sense of sorrow coming from the blade...”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“And then... When did I end up wearing it?”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Sorry, I can't remember...”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I believe by that point you were already under its spell.”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It seems to have been magicks which magnify the\nwielder's resentments and take control of their mind.”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Resentments? Such as?”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"Hotori casts her gaze downwards.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			{
"Seems like she is well aware.",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin. Go and step outside for a bit.”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Why?”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Because I said so.”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"It seems like Akari also has an idea.",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"I stand up without further objection.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"Soujin leaves the room.",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"Miyaguni waits for his footsteps to grow faint before she speaks.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Kotone. Do you know what exactly these resentments were?”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“No, not as of yet.”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I may be able to determine it if you were to give me some more time.”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's fine. No need to look into it.”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Oh, umm... Understood.”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"Although it felt like an out-of-body experience while I was under its spell, I can still faintly remember what I was thinking at the time.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Why must you steal Soujin from me?”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“If it weren't for you, Soujin would...”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Unforgivable.”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Unforgivable!”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			{
"Jealousy was the resentment that was animating me at the time.",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			{
"I was swept up by the delusion that Miyaguni was stealing Soujin away from me.",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			{
"I feel pathetic for having a jealous heart, so easily manipulated.",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			{
"It's proof that I'm not sufficiently self-disciplined.",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"Ah, so that's why Miyaguni sent Soujin out.",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"She's trying to be considerate of me.",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Thank you, Miyaguni.”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What for?”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
"Miyaguni plays dumb.",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Point is, it was all that fishy spellblade's fault.”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Let's leave it at that.”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			{
"I knew Miyaguni would say that.",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			{
"But as a warrior, I need to take responsibility for what I've done.",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			{
"For a crime so severe, the only choice is death.",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"I take up the dagger left by my bedside.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Inou, what do you think you're doing?”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Taking responsibility.”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“To bring harm to the Imperial Princess is a sin unto death.”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I won't permit that.”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I've gone against my fealty.”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Stay your hand!”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"Her command freezes my body in its place.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I've already told you that all is forgiven.”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Thus, if you wish to uphold your fealty, heed my will.”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			{
"Miyaguni... No─",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			{
"Her Imperial Highness's glare pierces into me.",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"It pins me in place, unable to even move a muscle.",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			{
"The warrior's blood coursing through me is powerless but to submit to its rightful sovereign.",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“The Forefather established for House Inou a two-thousand-year legacy of placing fealty above all else.”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“If I am to accept your forgiveness here, I'll never be able to look upon my ancestors.”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I would not be gratified by your death.”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It'd be nothing but senseless self-satisfaction.”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“But─”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“No buts!”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“U-Um, Hotori-sama?”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I apologize for repeating myself, but it really was the spellblade that─”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I appreciate the sentiment, but you're gravely mistaken.”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Eep?!”",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			{
"Kotone shuts herself up with a terrified expression.",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Can you please not bully my little Exalt-Priestess?”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			{
"I might have normally played along with her, but this isn't the time or place.",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It is only right and just that sin should be punished.”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You're every bit as hard-headed, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Well, I suppose I might start getting bored if you guys\nweren't this way.”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			{
"Miyaguni scoots forward until she's within arm's reach.",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If you seek punishment, then I'll gladly oblige.”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It'll make you wish you were dead, you hear?”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			{
"Miyaguni's eyes show no hint of a smile.",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“So, what say you? Will you accept it?”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“What kind of...”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Don't tell me you're the sort of coward that'd try to back down after their sentence is handed to them?”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			{
"My heart skips a beat.",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Well, what'll it be?”",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			{
"I harmed the Imperial Princess with my own two hands.",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			{
"On the honor of House Inou, I couldn't possibly decline to accept this punishment supposedly worse than death.",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			{
"I squeeze in my stomach and try to speak without my voice breaking.",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I shall accept.”",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Excellent.”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Would a warrior ever go back on their word?”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Never.”",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"With a suggestive grin, Miyaguni sits up with her back straight.",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			{
"She's going to hand down my sentence.",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Inou Hotori.”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Put me on the Imperial Throne.”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“What?!”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Serve me as my vassal and help me restore the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What do you think? A hundred times more difficult and painful than just killing yourself, am I right?”",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Are you messing with me?”",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It sounds like you're the one that's messing with me.”",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Surely you couldn't think that this is an easier feat than suicide?”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			{
"She's absolutely right, of course.",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“But that's no different from what we've been doing!”",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It most certainly is.”",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If you accept me as your lord, restoring the Empire will become your sworn duty, not merely a goal to strive for.”",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I shall not abide you to ever give up.”",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Or to ever take your own life before fulfilling your duty.”",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			{
"I see. I walked right into her setup.",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			{
"But I can't bring myself to resent her for it.",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			{
"In fact, like a weary traveler finally finding repose beneath the shade of a grand tree, my body is awash with the blissful lightness of relief.",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			{
"Is this the true power of the blood of the Imperial Family?",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I would hear your reply, in your own words.”",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“A warrior never goes back on their word.”",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			{
"I set my dagger aside and place both hands on the floor.",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I, Inou Hotori, swear before Your Imperial Highness to undyingly fulfill my duty as a faithful servant.”",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Upon my own life, I shall bring Your Imperial Highness to the throne.”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			{
"With every word, I sink deeper into my bow.",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			{
"At the same time, the pain in my body inexplicably fades away.",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			{
"The brazier in my heart audibly roars to life.",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Spare absolutely no effort for my sake.”",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Your will be done.”",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Excellent.”",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			{
"Miyaguni gives me a serene smile.",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			{
"With it, all the tension hanging in the air is dispersed.",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Okay, time for your first order.”",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“State your bidding.”",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Don't change the way that you talk with me...”",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Actually, it'd be nice if you could be even more casual!”",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You know, the same way that you talk to Shino at school.”",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			{
"That's a bad habit of mine.",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			{
"Whenever I get nervous, I always come off as harsh and unfriendly.",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			{
"Even though, on the inside, I'm always trying my best to watch my words.",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“N-No, that's...”",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hmm? What?”",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I hear and ob─”",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Ah, I mean...”",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I got it.”",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			{
"Miyaguni gives a nod of satisfaction.",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I've been meaning to ask. Why are you bowing, too, Kotone?”",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ah! When in the world!?”",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			{
"Kotone raises her head in a fluster.",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I'm terribly sorry. I just got caught up in the atmosphere!”",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“But I feel truly blessed that I was able to bear witness to an occasion such as this.”",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Hotori-sama, I am so glad for you.”",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Y-Yeah...”",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			{
"Kotone is tearing up just from having watched our little exchange.",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			{
"What a compassionate person she is.",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You're a real handful, Kotone.”",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Go and get Soujin once you've calmed down a little. We're done here.”",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Yes ma'am! I shall search for him to the very edges of the world if I must!”",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			{
"Miyaguni gently pats Kotone on the head.",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			{
"Miyaguni's presence seems to loom so much larger for some reason.",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			{
"It somehow feels as though Kotone and I have become her own children.",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			{
"I suppose this must be what it means to accept someone as your lord.",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			{
"As a result of Kotone's Healing, Hotori has recovered enough to walk on her own.",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			{
"Someone's phone starts ringing.",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It's mine.”",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			{
"Hotori answers her phone as she gingerly limps towards the corner of the hall.",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			{
"As she continues to listen, her face grows paler by the second.",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What is it?”",
			},
		},
		[259]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“The army raided our arsenal.”",
			},
		},
		[260]={
			{
"I'm at a loss for words.",
			},
		},
		[261]={
			{
"I never thought they'd sniff out the location of our arsenal, the storehouse for many of our spellblades.",
			},
		},
		[262]={
			{
"Its location is a closely guarded secret even within the Sworn Blades itself.",
			},
		},
		[263]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What's the damage?”",
			},
		},
		[264]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I don't know. At any rate, we need to get to headquarters.”",
			},
		},
		[265]={
			{
"Before anything else, we need get more information.",
			},
		},
		[266]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari, I'm sorry, but I need you to head─”",
			},
		},
		[267]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Miyaguni's coming with us.”",
			},
		},
		[268]={
			name={"name", name="Akari & Soujin"},
			{
"“Really?” “...Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[269]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Wait. If we let Akari into our headquarters...”",
			},
		},
		[270]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“She has my blessing.”",
			},
		},
		[271]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But you still haven't accepted Akari's...”",
			},
		},
		[272]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That's all resolved now.”",
			},
		},
		[273]={
			{
"Akari declares with a grin.",
			},
		},
		[274]={
			{
"If that's really the case, that's great news for me. But...",
			},
		},
		[275]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(It doesn't sit right...)”",
			},
		},
		[276]={
			{
"What did all the effort I spent on trying to reason with Hotori even come to?",
			},
		},
		[277]={
			{
"It is as though I was spectating a heated contest of bladesmanship, only for the match to suddenly be decided while I was in the privy.",
			},
		},
		[278]={
			{
"But perhaps I should really be praising Akari for changing\nHotori's mind in such a short span of time.",
			},
		},
		[279]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Get a move on, Soujin! We're gonna leave you behind!”",
			},
